BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: TILE Language Party
UID:event_316343856@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260926T045643Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260930T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260930T204500
SUMMARY:Wednesday - JOIN WAITLIST -  ESL English X Korean Language Exchang
 e\, Class&Games
DESCRIPTION:Toronto's BIGGEST Language Exchange Social Event + Class\n**\\
 #\\#\\# ⚠️ If the class is listed as full\\\, PLEASE JOIN the waitlist
  and we will let guests in based on the class’ needs to balance the numb
 er of Korean & English speakers\\!**\n\n**\\#\\#\\# 👨‍🏫** **KOREAN
  X ENGLISH LANGUAGE EXCHANGE**\n\n* *************Mini English Class with C
 ertified Teacher + Board Games*** **🎲********\n\n**###** **⚠️ Space
  is VERY LIMITED** **so register ASAP to save your spot!**\n\n***We can on
 ly accept a limited number of guests due to the venue's space limitations.
 ***\n\n**💰** **SPECIAL PROMOTION COST** **🎉:**\n**If this is your fi
 rst or second TILE. Event\, the class is** **FREE\, JUST buy 1 item from t
 he Café Princess Menu**\n\n**If you have already attended more than 2 TIL
 E events: pay $3 + buy any menu item from the Café Princess menu**\n**\\-
 \\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-**\n\
 n**###** **📍 LOCATION: CAFÉ PRINCESS**\n\n* **5590 Yonge Street\, Nort
 h York**\n* **Across the street from** **FINCH SUBWAY STATION**\n**near Sh
 oppers Drug Mart**\n\n**###** ***📅*** **DAY:** ***Every*** ***Wednesday
 ***\n\n* **🕡 Time: 6:30 PM – 8:45 PM** **⏰**\n\n**Please register A
 SAP** **if you want to attend on Sept 3rd so we can save your spot!**\n\n*
 **We had roughly 80 people sign up for the last two events... but we only 
 have space for 30 people max.***\n**\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\
 -\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-*
 *\n**After registering\, please do the following on Sept. 30th :**\n\n1. *
 *✅ Do your best to arrive on time @ Café Princess (6:30 PM)**\n1. **✅
  Tell us whether you want to focus on learning/practicing ENGLISH or KOREA
 N**\n1. **✅ Tell us your level: Beginner\, Intermediate\, Advanced or Ex
 pert**\n1. **✅** **Buy 1 item from the Café Princess Menu** **(This is 
 the only cost if this is your 1st or 2nd class. There is an additional $5 
 fee starting from your third class onwards)**\n\n**\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\
 -\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-**\n
 **✨ Popular menu items include:**\n\n* ***🍓 Strawberry Cheesecake Bin
 gsu***\n* ***🍧 Mango or Oreo Bingsu***\n* ***☕ Matcha & Tiramisu Latt
 es***\n* ***🧇 Princess Waffles with Ice Cream & Much More***\n\n**###**
  **What to Expect**\n\n* ***🇰🇷 Guided Korean & English language prac
 tice***\n* ***📚 Interactive mini-lesson led by an award-winning certifi
 ed teacher***\n* ***🗣️ Structured conversation activities with native
  and fluent speakers***\n* ***🎲 Board games and social activities to pr
 actice language naturally***\n* ***🤝 Make new friends while improving y
 our communication skills***\n\n**👨‍🏫** **MEET YOUR TEACHER & HOST*
 *\n**###** **Learn From an Expert Language Teacher**\n\n***John Dias (OCT\
 , PhD researcher\, MA\, BEd\, HBA & EELC) is an award-winning certified la
 nguage teacher with 10+ years experience***\n\n**###** **Who Should Attend
 ?**\n\n* ***English learners (ESL)***\n* ***Native Korean speakers wanting
  to practice English***\n* ***Korean learners of all levels***\n* ***Inter
 national students\, newcomers\, professionals\, and anyone interested in l
 anguage and culture***\n\n**Feel free to** **📧** **e-mail [info@tilelea
 rning.com](mailto:info@tilelearning.com) if you have any questions.**\n**C
 heck out our** **🌐** **[website](https://www.tilelearning.com/) and [in
 stagram](https://www.instagram.com/tilelearning/) accounts for more detail
 s.**
