SUMMARY:Toronto’s BIGGEST Language Exchange Social Event Party + Bonus C
 lass by [TILE.]
DESCRIPTION:Toronto's BIGGEST Language Exchange Social Event + Class\n**Jo
 in [TILE.]** at the **most popular Saturday Language Learning Social Event
  & Party in Toronto! 🍁**\n\n**[TILE.] = Toronto International Language 
 Exchange [Instagram](https://www.instagram.com/tilelearning/) & [Website](
 https://www.tilelearning.com/)**\n\n**[TILE.]** now has a **2-for-1 specia
 l event\,** which includes:\n**1.** From **[6:30 - 7:15 PM](https://www.me
 etup.com/english-class-with-certified-award-winning-teacher):** An optiona
 l $5 small group 45-minute **[English language class](https://www.meetup.c
 om/english-class-with-certified-award-winning-teacher)** taught by an awar
 d-winning certified language teacher with 10+ years experience (OCT\, Univ
 ersity of Toronto PhD researcher\, MA\, BEd & HBA)\n\n**2.** From **[7:15 
 - 11 PM](https://www.meetup.com/biggest-language-party-event-social-in-tor
 onto):** Our usual huge group **[BIGGEST LANGUAGE EXCHANGE SOCIAL EVENT AN
 D PARTY IN TORONTO](https://www.meetup.com/biggest-language-party-event-so
 cial-in-toronto)** (Cost: *$5\, unless you already paid for the same day 6
 :30 English class right before\, in which which case the 7:15 social is FR
 EE)*\n\nBoth events happen Saturday on the 2nd floor of the Madison Pub (1
 4 Madison Avenue). ***Attend either or both events for $5!***\n\n**Join us
  for:**\n**✅ 💬🌎🎉 Language Exchanges and Learning in a Fun Setti
 ng**\n**✅ 🤝🗣️🥳 Meeting New Friends & Networking**\n**✅ 🃏
